# TypeScript + App Router

- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for browser state, effects, or browser-only APIs.
- Prefer typed domain shapes (`Artist`, `Artwork`) over passing raw CMS response objects through the tree (when CMS exists).
- Avoid `any`; document exceptions.
- Keep data-fetching in `lib/` modules when integrations exist; pages call meaningful functions.
- Prefer composition and small props APIs over mega-components with many optional variants.
- Use the `@/*` import alias for project files.
